[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3428806417","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111887#issuecomment-3428806417","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111887","id":3428806417,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7MX28R","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-21T18:46:00Z","updated_at":"2025-10-21T18:46:00Z","body":"This is expected behavior, you're never setting the value in the setter (effectively discarding the exported value when it's being set).\n\nChanging `TestResource.gd` to:\n```gdscript\nclass_name TestResource\nextends Resource\n\n@export var value_without_setter: float = 1.0\n\n@export var value_with_setter: float = 1.0:\n    set(v):\n        print(\"Set value \", v)\n        value_with_setter = v # <-------------------- Added.\n```\nmakes \"the issue\" go away, as expected.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3428806417/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":